Cell["\<\
Primitive tetragonal lattice (gray group 123): a = b and c = 3 a/2 give a \
square prism. Its height in reciprocal space is 2 Pi/c:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"285e3908-8148-4ad0-9a82-90673795a6ee"],

