Cell["\<\
Monoclinic lattice (gray group 10): the first and third primitive vectors \
enclose 70 degrees. Hide the path to inspect the zone faces; the Wigner-Seitz \
zone is not simply the skew reciprocal primitive cell:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"50cfeadb-cde4-4a61-9b5e-ad0085950d95"],

